---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — DCS Y2K">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[820px] p-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="h-display mb-4 text-[56px] md:text-[72px]">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="eyebrow mb-12 border-b border-ink pb-6 text-mute">Last updated: September 23, 2026</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 leading-relaxed text-body">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>DCS Y2K ("we", "us") operates this website. This policy explains what personal data we collect, why, and the rights you have over it under the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and other applicable data protection laws.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">2. Data we collect</h2>
        <p>When you create an account, place an order, or contact us, we may collect your name, email address, shipping address, and order history. We also collect limited technical data (such as pages viewed) to keep the site running smoothly.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">3. Why we collect it</h2>
        <p>We use your data to process orders, manage your account, respond to support requests, and improve the shopping experience. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">4. Your GDPR rights</h2>
        <p>If you are located in the European Economic Area, you have the right to access, correct, export, or delete your personal data, and to object to or restrict certain processing. To exercise any of these rights, contact us using the details below.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">5. Data retention</h2>
        <p>We keep account and order data for as long as your account is active, or as needed to comply with legal obligations, after which it is deleted or anonymized.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy or your data can be sent through our <a href="#" class="font-semibold underline">Contact us</a> page.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
